    "bbox": [
      188.49,
      203.93,
      375.33,
      215.27
    ],
    "text": "AN ACT TO ABOLISH THE DEATH PENALTY AND TO MAKE",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      235.05,
      217.25,
      328.64,
      228.59
    ],
    "text": "CONSEQUENTIAL PROVISIONS",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      7.0,
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      244.13,
      401.91,
      268.79
    ],
    "text": "BE it enacted by the Parliament of the Democratic SocialistRepublic of Sri Lanka as follows:-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      284.33,
      401.86,
      308.99
    ],
    "text": "1.This Act may be cited as the Abolition of DeathPenalty Act, No. of 2019.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      324.53,
      401.91,
      376.07
    ],
    "text": "2.The reference in any Act to the imposition of thedeath penalty or punishment by death, shall, from and afterthe coming into force of this Act, be amended and construedas punishment by imprisonment for life.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      391.49,
      401.88,
      443.03
    ],
    "text": "3.(a) Any person in respect of whom a sentence of deathhas been imposed prior to the coming into force of this Act,shall be deemed to be a person sentenced to imprisonmentfor life in respect of such offence.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      454.13,
      401.93,
      514.07
    ],
    "text": "(b) Any person who has committed, prior to the cominginto force of this Act, an offence punishable with death, butin respect of whom a sentence of punishment has not yetbeen imposed by Court, shall be deemed to have committedan offence punishable with imprisonment for life.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      161.85,
      528.77,
      401.9,
      553.07
    ],
    "text": "4.In the event of any inconsistency between the Sinhalaand Tamil texts of this Act, the Sinhala text shall prevail.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      10.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      407.85,
      393.91,
      449.86,
      412.58
    ],
